# Per-machine fish settings. Copy this file to `config.local.fish` in the same directory and fill in
# this machine's values. `config.local.fish` is gitignored (machine-local); this `.example` is
# tracked as a template. `config.fish` sources `config.local.fish` last, so anything set here
# overrides the shared configuration.
#
# This repository is public, so anything that identifies an account, a host, or an employer belongs
# here rather than in `config.fish`.
